'''Extradimensional Crisis''' (Japanese: '''{{j|異次元クライシス}}''' ''Extradimensional Crisis'') is the fourth themed booster pack, and seventh expansion overall, in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]].

== Information ==
'''Extradimensional Crisis''' is the fourth themed booster pack released through [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. The expansion focuses on [[Ultra Beast]]s.

